  "_arealueberbauung_note": "arealueberbauung_ausnuetzungsziffer_max_pct/vollgeschosse_max/fassadenhoehe_max_m are the Art. 7(1)/(2) per-zone Arealüberbauung bonus figures. Art. 8 preisgünstiger Wohnraum bonus (opt-in only, +15pp for W3/W4b, +20pp for übrige Wohnzonen -- not encoded per-zone here since it's a flat two-tier rule, applied directly in areal.js) and Art. 9 cantonal distances (kantonale-abstandsvorschriften.json) live elsewhere -- do not duplicate that logic against this file's per-zone data. Art. 6: Arealüberbauung excluded entirely in W2bI/W2bII/W2bIII/W2 (arealueberbauung_zulaessig: false above), and requires combined Arealfläche >= 4000 sqm (checked in areal.js, not zone-dependent).",

  "_kronenbedeckungsgrad_note": "Full table now sourced from Art. 53 Abs. 2, E-BZO (build plan section 4 only gave the W3 example, 25%): W2bI/W2bII/W2bIII=30%, W2/W3/W4b=25%, W4/W5b/W5c/W5/W6=20%, Zentrumszonen=15%, Industrie-/Gewerbezonen=15%. Zentrums- and Industrie-/Gewerbezonen values are out of scope for this v1 (Wohnzonen only) but recorded here since they were on the same table and cost nothing to keep."
